<<loadNPC 0 "saddled_steed">>

당신은 당신의 <<horseHairKr $farm.steed>> <<beasttype>>에게 안장을 얹고, 그 위에 올라탄다.
<br><br>

<<if $farm.stable gte 1>>
	<<steedicon>><<link [[마을까지 타고 간다 (0:15)|Farm Ride Town]]>><<if $worn.lower.name is "naked" and $worn.under_lower.name is "naked">><<pain 6>><</if>><<tiredness 2>><<pass 15>><</link>><<gtiredness>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<<steedicon>><<link [[마을까지 타고 간다 (0:30)|Farm Ride Town]]>><<if $worn.lower.name is "naked" and $worn.under_lower.name is "naked">><<pain 9>><</if>><<tiredness 3>><<pass 30>><</link>><<gtiredness>>
	<br>
<</if>>
